<title>USA: Littlefield, Adams in Heinz license pact.</title>
<headline>Littlefield, Adams in Heinz license pact.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Littlefield, Adams &amp; Co, which prints licensed apparel, said on Wednesday it had entered into a license agreement with H.J. Heinz Co unit Heinz U.S.A. for the Heinz trademarks and tradenames.</p>
<p>The agreement would run through October 14, 1998, and covered Littlefield, Adams &amp; Co's line of t-shirts, sweatshirts and boxer shorts, Littlefield said.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
